    {"id":"CLM-B08","statement":"“大模型应用工程师”是企业岗位实例名而不是当前国家职业分类名称。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-GOV-CLASS-01","SEG-GOV-GENAI-01","SEG-JD-CSSC-01","SEG-JD-LIZHI-01"]},
    {"id":"CLM-B09","statement":"市场别名至少包括大模型应用开发工程师、大模型应用后端工程师、AI大模型应用开发工程师和高级大模型应用算法工程师；别名不能单靠词面合并。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"moderate","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-JD-BYTE-01","SEG-JD-DIDI-01","SEG-JD-FUDAN-01","SEG-JD-FANRUAN-01"]},
    {"id":"CLM-B10","statement":"目标岗位的稳定价值中心是把业务需求和可用模型转化为可评价、可集成、可运行、可迭代的应用系统。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-GOV-AISTD-05","SEG-GOV-AISTD-07","SEG-JD-BYTE-01","SEG-JD-DIDI-01","SEG-JD-CSSC-01","SEG-JD-LIZHI-01"]},
    {"id":"CLM-B11","statement":"大模型算法工程师的区分重点是模型/算法创新、后训练与深度优化；目标岗位可以协作或做有限适配，但不以原创模型算法为稳定中心。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"moderate","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-JD-TENCENT-02","SEG-JD-TENCENT-03","SEG-JD-MEITUAN-02","SEG-JD-MEITUAN-03","SEG-JD-DIDI-01"]},
    {"id":"CLM-B12","statement":"AI Infra/LLMOps岗位的区分重点是组织级通用平台、资源与框架底座；目标岗位负责应用侧集成与运行，可能在小团队兼任部分平台职责。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"moderate","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-JD-JDINFRA-01","SEG-JD-JDINFRA-02","SEG-JD-JDINFRA-03","SEG-JD-DIDI-03"]},
    {"id":"CLM-B13","statement":"后端工程能力是目标岗位的重要实现基础，但仅做通用业务接口和分布式服务、未承担模型行为与质量闭环的后端岗位不属于目标岗位。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"moderate","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-JD-BYTE-03","SEG-JD-DIDI-02","SEG-JD-LIZHI-03","SEG-JD-FUDAN-02"]},
    {"id":"CLM-B14","statement":"Agent工程师可视为目标岗位的方向性别名或子域；只有当职责主要是通用Agent平台内核时，边界才更接近AI Infra/框架工程。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"moderate","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-JD-FANRUAN-01","SEG-JD-FANRUAN-03","SEG-JD-JDINFRA-01","SEG-TECH-AGENT-02"]},

    {"id":"CLM-T01","statement":"典型工作首先需要把用户、流程、约束和失败代价转成可验证的应用需求。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-GOV-AISTD-03","SEG-GOV-AISTD-05","SEG-EDU-06","SEG-JD-BYTE-03"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T02","statement":"需求任务的交付边界应是场景与验收说明，而不是“理解业务”这类无边界职责。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"research_inference","strength":"moderate","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-GOV-AISTD-03","SEG-EDU-06","SEG-TECH-EVAL-02"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T03","statement":"方案任务需要比较直接模型调用、固定工作流、RAG、Agent和条件性模型适配，而不是默认采用最复杂架构。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-TECH-AGENT-01","SEG-TECH-AGENT-02","SEG-JD-BYTE-01","SEG-JD-CSSC-01"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T04","statement":"方案设计必须同时考虑安全、成本、质量、可扩展性和部署边界。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"direct_fact","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-GOV-AISTD-07","SEG-REG-02","SEG-NIST-02"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T05","statement":"知识与RAG建设是跨多个企业样本出现的独立工作对象，交付物包括可更新的知识处理和检索链路及其质量结果。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-JD-DIDI-02","SEG-JD-LIZHI-02","SEG-JD-FANRUAN-01","SEG-JD-FUDAN-01","SEG-TECH-RAG-01"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T06","statement":"RAG质量不能只看最终答案；检索组件需要有查询—相关文档标注和单独的召回、精度与排名评价。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"direct_fact","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-TECH-RAG-01","SEG-TECH-RAG-02","SEG-TECH-RAG-03"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T07","statement":"Agent/工作流与工具集成是可辨认的典型任务，其工作对象是状态、步骤、工具契约、权限和外部系统。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-JD-BYTE-02","SEG-JD-DIDI-02","SEG-JD-FANRUAN-01","SEG-TECH-MCP-01","SEG-TECH-AGENT-03"]},
