    {"id":"CLM-T09","statement":"上下文与模型行为控制应管理Prompt、工具描述、外部数据、历史、结构化输出和模型路由，而不是把Prompt写作当成全部工作。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-TECH-CONTEXT-01","SEG-TECH-CONTEXT-03","SEG-JD-BYTE-02","SEG-JD-CSSC-01"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T10","statement":"模型行为控制任务的完成边界是版本化配置和在目标案例上的可复核行为结果。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"research_inference","strength":"moderate","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-TECH-CONTEXT-03","SEG-TECH-EVAL-01","SEG-JD-CSSC-01"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T11","statement":"质量评测是独立典型任务，流程应包含目标、数据集、指标、比较、回归和发布判断。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-TECH-EVAL-01","SEG-TECH-EVAL-02","SEG-JD-WIZ-02","SEG-JD-FANRUAN-02"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T12","statement":"评测集应混合真实反馈、历史日志、专家构造案例，并覆盖典型、边缘和对抗输入。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"direct_fact","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-TECH-EVAL-03","SEG-NIST-01"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T13","statement":"服务化交付与发布是典型任务，包含接口集成、测试环境到正式环境的交付、部署升级、性能验证和文档。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-GOV-AISTD-04","SEG-GOV-AISTD-05","SEG-JD-DIDI-03","SEG-JD-FUDAN-02"]},
    {"id":"CLM-T14","statement":"生产运行需要监控延迟、吞吐、队列、容量、错误与业务质量，并在异常时保留可复现证据。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"strong","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-JD-DIDI-03","SEG-JD-FANRUAN-02","SEG-TECH-VLLM-01","SEG-TECH-VLLM-02","SEG-TECH-VLLM-03"]},
