    {"id":"CLM-T17","statement":"交付后的技术文档、培训和支持是常见生命周期工作，但通常附着于交付/运行任务，不单列为核心任务。","status":"accepted","assertionType":"cross_source_synthesis","strength":"moderate","evidenceSegmentIds":["SEG-GOV-GENAI-04","SEG-GOV-AISTD-06","SEG-JD-FUDAN-02"]},

